[info] Avoid passing \`@user\` directly to \`link_to\`. The URL is resolved implicitly through polymorphic routing, so what actually gets rendered can't be read off the template or traced by tooling. Use an explicit route helper like \`user_path(@user)\`, or \`polymorphic_path(@user)\` when the route has to be resolved from the model. (actionview-no-implicit-polymorphic-url)

